<%- include('../partials/head',{title:'About ReLoop'}) %><%- include('../partials/public-nav') %><main class="public-page"><section class="page-hero"><div class="public-container narrow"><span class="eyebrow light">About ReLoop</span><h1>One platform for practical circular-economy operations.</h1><p>ReLoop is a centralized recycling marketplace and operations platform connecting waste producers, collectors and recycling partners under one ReLoop-managed system.</p></div></section><section class="public-section"><div class="public-container narrow prose"><h2>What ReLoop is designed to solve</h2><p>Recycling often becomes difficult when collection requests, weight records, partner delivery and payment information live in separate places. ReLoop brings those steps into one accountable workflow.</p><h2>What ReLoop is not</h2><p>ReLoop is not a multi-tenant SaaS product where each organization buys a separate copy of the platform. Partners participate in the ReLoop marketplace while the Platform Owner retains control of platform rules, security and operations.</p></div></section></main><%- include('../partials/foot') %>
